Avoid passing raw `Map<String, dynamic>` objects through the entire application.

Create typed models:

```dart
class User {
  final String id;
  final String name;

  const User({
    required this.id,
    required this.name,
  });

  factory User.fromJson(Map<String, dynamic> json) {
    return User(
      id: json['id'] as String,
      name: json['name'] as String,
    );
  }
}
```

For larger projects, code generation can reduce repetitive serialization code.

Keep API models separate from domain models when the external API structure differs significantly from the application's internal representation.

