Use `Form` and `TextFormField` for structured forms.

```dart
final formKey = GlobalKey<FormState>();

Form(
  key: formKey,
  child: TextFormField(
    validator: (value) {
      if (value == null || value.isEmpty) {
        return 'Required';
      }
      return null;
    },
  ),
)
```

Validate at the appropriate boundaries:

```text
UI → basic format validation
backend → authorization and business rules
server → final trust boundary
```

Examples:

- Required fields.
- Email format.
- Minimum password length.
- Numeric ranges.
- Maximum text length.
- File size/type.

> [!WARNING]
> Client-side validation improves UX but must never be treated as the only security validation.

